# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
# The owner defers option, debug and pondering support. Registration is out of scope.
# Fisher skips the rest of each ignored line, including command-looking arguments.
> setoption name Path value quit
> debug on isready
> ponderhit isready
> register name quit code example
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok. The four preceding commands are silent.
< readyok
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
